  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — AI Gets Its Own Bank Account — Banking Will Never Be the Same | November 12, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — AI Gets Its Own Bank Account — Banking Will Never Be the Same | November 12, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              November 12, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              AI Gets Its Own Bank Account — Banking Will Never Be the Same\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Wirex has launched <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\"><strong>Navoka</strong></a> — the world's first AI agent with its own dedicated bank account and payment card. This isn't a chatbot or a co-pilot. It's an autonomous financial actor that can hold funds, initiate payments, and transact entirely on its own authority.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Navoka is a fully agentic AI system built by crypto-native fintech Wirex, designed to pay for services and transactions independently from a dedicated bank account and card it holds in its own name</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The agent operates without requiring human approval for each transaction — it understands context, goals, and spending constraints and executes autonomously</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Wirex positions Navoka as infrastructure for the emerging \"agentic economy\" where AI systems, not just humans, are economic participants</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The dedicated card and account structure gives Navoka legal financial standing as a distinct entity, not merely a tool operating under a human's credentials</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">This launch follows a wave of AI agent deployments at banks, but marks the first time an AI agent itself — rather than the human behind it — is the named account holder</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Every KYC, AML, and fraud system in banking was built to identify, verify, and monitor <strong>humans</strong>. Navoka represents the arrival of a structurally different category of account holder. If Wirex can get an AI agent through compliance and onto payment rails, every challenger bank and neobank will follow. Traditional banks now face a non-trivial question: how do you apply customer due diligence to an entity that has no passport, no tax ID, and no legal personhood?</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The payments infrastructure implications are equally significant. When AI agents hold balances and initiate real transactions at scale, card scheme rules, transaction monitoring thresholds, and settlement rails need to evolve. Regulators haven't weighed in yet — but the BIS, MAS, and FCA will all be watching Navoka closely. <strong>Financial institutions that wait for regulatory clarity will be playing catch-up.</strong></p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Feedzai adds AI agent detection to digital banking fraud prevention</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNVktLajhxaHpldVZuWGJFZVVNb2lQTjBNYVlOdkFPTUw4cnNCa18wNk5iMHJVcFFBcVpab2YyYnhwR0k1RGhzYzV1NTJtcnpUVEhvaDBSRS1JYnppd1p1TC1qaG5YOUlzWlNnNHdELUw1MkgzSkg4ZlU5bVNJbmtJd0N4UXpJRUFjZGFDbnBoUlNYdVV0d2N3ZHJzbWlQN29TWDRTQ05YbnVlUQ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Biometric Update</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Feedzai has expanded its Digital Trust platform with AI agent detection capabilities, enabling banks to identify when transactions are initiated by AI agents rather than humans. The system flags non-human behavioral patterns in real time at the front door of digital banking.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>The compliance inflection point:</strong> As AI agents begin transacting on behalf of customers at scale, banks need automated tooling to distinguish human from machine-initiated activity — Feedzai's move signals this is no longer a theoretical problem.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Starling Bank Debuts 'Talk to Transact' Voice Payments via Agentic AI</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOalNCNTloQjZYNjRlOHBiZC03cnpOOURkTG1ZZlcxT3NnMkhLb3ZmTG8weFlpcm1VRERESjRFMW84cFJGODJGV2F6T0hGSjk3VmRsMXVzZUoxTjh3WnE4M2dEbm9RMS1PUnM3WTJ3Z1pkZlg0U1RTMEhMV1hReXBXcWo0M3VSTnpDMEwxNkp3?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FF News</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Starling Bank has launched a voice-driven agentic payment experience called 'Talk to Transact,' letting customers authorize and execute payments through natural language conversation with an AI agent embedded in its mobile app.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Voice as the new payments UI:</strong> Starling's move signals that conversational AI is graduating from chatbot to transaction executor — a UX shift that will pressure other retail banks to follow or fall behind on accessibility and customer experience.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>Banks face mounting cyber risks as digital and agentic payments expand</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPY05GNDdTVWdHNXFOakllZWFwNHdyTmhOUGpxeU8tZGszd2hWU0t3a0dKWDNSOGM3RFl6Z243OFEwdzVEbnhwRVhuQl9aSUdMYnJoRjVYYmo0UEdDenJpeUxGeEp2RWRIcUdQa193QkFCQjRVLUxQaUFVWXJ2aXdDOVUwcTRLd1lMOHA0aTBmcVB6UEF6UDF2QnBYSXBOTXU4UGJ1NERjOGx0Z1ZMV2ZNZ2lnclJxX2ZETm9lTXpnVQ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Retail Banker International</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            A new industry analysis warns that banks' cyber risk surface is expanding rapidly as agentic AI systems gain access to payment infrastructure. Autonomous agents operating across digital banking rails introduce new attack vectors, including agent impersonation and privilege escalation.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Security architecture needs a rethink:</strong> Traditional perimeter defenses weren't designed for AI agents that authenticate dynamically and operate across multiple systems simultaneously — banks need to treat agent identity and privilege management as a first-class security concern.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Google's Gemini 4 Hydrogen outscores the bigger Argon just four weeks after its launch</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQTmh1dmJNRjlxdXc3eHVTTHlkb0NxX3d6YWJGQ21MOThka0tOUlFaMUlsZHlWQ2xFd3E4WE1ORzFPeFl6NDdsV1ktZlppd2ZHRUpVSnIxRVFkenNJWDdKbXRaaFcxNkJqVkhVX19zSkV1YnZtd2htMWRhOUNaUFNjUmN3ZHdaWFBHRTYxc1ZxYzJoQ1ZoakdSb0hmTXlUb0NZUFNQbDByQThGVzhTNnY0?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Decoder</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Google's smaller, faster Gemini 4 Hydrogen model has surpassed its larger predecessor Argon on key benchmarks just one month after launch. The result challenges the assumption that bigger models always win and signals a capability inflection point for cost-efficient enterprise AI.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>The efficiency race reshapes procurement:</strong> If smaller models now outperform larger ones, the enterprise AI cost calculus changes — banks running inference at scale should pressure-test their model choices against the latest benchmarks before locking in long-term infrastructure commitments.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>Anthropic's IPO Is About Six Times Oversubscribed</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQeWxnOC1MRXVQbUJwaDdiSDE3TzdIbVRyYU5qWnF5YzkycUVPTXV0bUhOWEIzWU1xejMyQXJxaGtHT2dQbk1iTExkc29hYjBpQWRsY3RTaEtsTVhVaFJjOHl5aW5nb0dDYzRwcWxjVXpkbWw1bU5lSFhwVHo4aGw4bHJZYlNZTUVoN2VwYnhBWmNDNURMbXNmN2FvaEVONS1CVG1MY004MzdMbTRJd1E2eQ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Bloomberg</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic's IPO is reportedly six times oversubscribed, reflecting intense institutional investor demand for the AI safety-focused lab behind Claude. The offering, in the middle of an active IPO roadshow, signals the market is pricing AI infrastructure as a category-defining bet.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>What it means for enterprise AI strategy:</strong> A 6x oversubscribed IPO at Anthropic's scale validates that AI foundation model providers are being treated as long-duration infrastructure assets — financial institutions building on Claude should expect accelerated R&amp;D investment and product expansion.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Agentic Startups to Watch 🚀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Startup entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- Startup entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Company name + tagline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            <strong>1. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNVWxVWnFDYjd5S0s3RnkweF9vcVNpREI4clRUODNPNnRjMU4xR3FrTnkzZENmY1hOVm5fTG9ORVhPb2Z4UmN2ZzU4d05EVHg5VFB1bWlMejhxYzg4YlAyUWpJNGdsQjFXclh2TjRuSWNOc050STdyRXJMaDRMcGxtVkFYYWhQWDNOYlVUak5vTDJUNmFJcXhlekdpR3gwUQ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">LangChain</a></strong> &mdash; <strong>Platform for building, deploying, and managing production AI agent workflows</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Lang